# The reference twin enforces the same theorem boundary as the native
# soundness adapter, and states the same decision: kernel.md section 4's
# group criterion rather than a blanket rule, naming the two members whose
# transcript effect makes the group indecomposable. This is deliberately not
# a carrier/seal refusal.
#
# REQUIRES: uv
# RUN: %uv python %S/Inputs/reference_interleaving.py | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: interleaved reduction bodies {{.*}} are both non-central
# CHECK-SAME: does not decompose per-transformer
# CHECK-SAME: requires an exact composite soundness rule
